# 💡 Example Future Interaction

Once the complete agent is implemented, a user will be able to upload:

```text
ecommerce_sales.csv
```

and ask:

```text
Which product category generated the most revenue in 2025?
```

The agent will perform:

```text
User Question
      ↓
Intent Analysis
      ↓
Analysis Planning
      ↓
SQL Generation
      ↓
SQL Validation
      ↓
DuckDB Execution
      ↓
Result Validation
      ↓
Visualization
      ↓
Insight Generation
```

And return:

```text
Electronics generated the highest revenue
in 2025 with total revenue of ₹18.43 lakh.
```

along with the relevant visualization and SQL query.

---

# 🎯 Final Objective

The final objective is to build a reliable AI data analyst that combines:

```text
LLM Reasoning
      +
Agentic Workflows
      +
Deterministic Data Processing
      +
SQL Analytics
      +
Machine Learning
      +
Data Visualization
```

The LLM will handle reasoning and planning, while actual numerical computation and database operations will be performed by deterministic tools such as DuckDB, Pandas, and Scikit-learn.

This separation is intended to reduce hallucinations and improve analytical reliability.

